# fixedbugs, defect 2364, lane p239-land-a, 2026-11-09 (panel 239's R4 and
# R5; the briefs' `both`).
#
# This module spells `pa.Pa` and `rb.Rb`, and each header defines the macro
# that widens the other's record, so in either order one of the two reads
# otherwise than its own module reads it. Refused before any unit compiles,
# both records named, told on this module's first value of one of them.
# Before the repair one record was refused by the walk's order, *`Rb.a` is
# `long long`*, false of `rb.h` as module `rb` reads it.
use fixedbugs2364/pa
use fixedbugs2364/rb

function main()
    p = pa.make(v: 4)  #~ ffi_record_two_layouts
    r = rb.make(v: 3)
    print(p.w + r.a)
